    清 | qīng | clear; pure; distinct | Has water radical 氵 on the left instead of 忄
    晴 | qíng | sunny; clear sky | Has sun radical 日 on the left instead of 忄
    睛 | jīng | eye; pupil | Has eye radical 目 on the left instead of 忄
    精 | jīng | essence; refined; smart | Has rice radical 米 on the left instead of 忄
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    情 | qíng | emotion; feeling; condition
    清 | qīng | clear; limpid; transparent
    晴 | qíng | clear weather; fine day
    青 | qīng | verdant green; youth
    静 | jìng | still; quiet; tranquil

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 表情 focuses on the dynamic, transient facial configuration conveying immediate mood or reaction.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 表情 vs. 神情 | shénqíng | 表情 refers strictly to localized physical muscle movements of the face (眉毛, 嘴角), whereas 神情 encompasses the broader, lingering spiritual demeanor and aura of the eyes and posture (神情落寞).
    2 | 表情 vs. 脸色 | liǎnsè | 脸色 refers either to skin complexion (脸色苍白) or to cold, disapproving social attitudes (看人脸色), while 表情 is purely emotional configuration.
    3 | 表情 vs. 动作 | dòngzuò | 表情 is of the face, while 动作 involves limbs, torso, and bodily physical movements.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 幼童的脸庞宛如一汪澄澈的清潭，喜怒哀乐尽显于瞬息万变的生动表情之中。没有成人的伪装与遮掩，那一抹无邪的微笑犹如清晨的第一缕朝阳，不仅瞬间融化了成人世界的冷漠，更唤醒了我们心底久违的纯真与美好。 | Yòutóng de liǎnpáng wǎnrú yì wāng chéngchè de qīngtán, xǐ-nù-āi-lè jìnxiǎn yú shùnxī-wànbiàn de shēngdòng biǎoqíng zhīzhōng. Méiyǒu chéngrén de wěizhuāng yǔ zhēyǎn, nà yì mǒ wúxié de wēixiào yóurú qīngchén de dì-yī lǚ zhāoyáng, bùjǐn shùnjiān rónghuà le chéngrén shìjiè de lěngmò, gèng huànxǐng le wǒmen xīndǐ jiǔwéi de chúnzhēn yǔ měihǎo. | An infant's face is a clear pool; emotions reveal themselves in rapid, vivid expressions. Free from adult pretense, that innocent smile melts coldness like morning dawn, awakening long-lost innocence and wonder in our hearts. | El rostro de un infante es remanso limpio donde las emociones se dibujan en gestos vivos. Sin antifaces adultos, su sonrisa pura derrite el desdén mundano como sol del alba, despertando la inocencia dormida en el corazón.
  #2 | 在现代人机交互与情感计算前沿领域，基于高精度传感器的人脸微表情识别技术正在取得重大突破。通过毫秒级捕捉面部肌肉群的细微颤动，智能系统能够精准感知用户的真实情绪状态，为智慧医疗与远程教育注入更具温度的人文关怀。 | Zài xiàndài rénjī jiāohù yǔ qínggǎn jìsuàn qiányán lǐngyù, jīyú gāojīngdù chuángǎnqì de rénliàn wēibiǎoqíng shíbié jìshù zhèngzài qǔdé zhòngdà tūpò. Tōngguò háomiǎojí bǔzhuō miànbù jīròuqún de xìwēi chàndòng, zhìnéng xìtǒng nénggòu jīngzhǔn gǎnzhī yònghù de zhēnshí qíngxù zhuàngtài, wèi zhìhuì yīliáo yǔ yuǎnchéng jiàoyù zhùrù gèng jù wēndù de rénwén guānhuái. | In affective computing, facial micro-expression recognition based on precision sensors is achieving breakthroughs. Capturing muscular twitches in milliseconds allows smart systems to perceive emotional states, infusing humanistic warmth into telemedicine. | En la interacción hombre-máquina, el reconocimiento de microexpresiones faciales abre sendas punteras. Al captar temblores musculares al milisegundo, los sistemas inteligentes auscultan el ánimo del usuario, aportando calidez humana a la telemedicina.
